 because  mana was coming in through gate  collections  accomodation restaurant specialized  programs those are not happening anymore  even if the lockdown and soon tourism  will take time to recover in the  meantime the virtual tours are springing  up and online donation pages hoping to  secure enough support until gates can  reopen charlie angela al jazeera  hampshire
 

